{
  "plugin": "stock-news",
  "_comment": "The ticker is a Vegas scroll: frame 0 is off-panel and renders blank, so every shot steps frames. Headlines are seeded onto the plugin instance because the fetch cache key includes a time bucket derived from time.time(), which the docs shim does not freeze. The ticker symbols and companies are invented, and the logo is a generated stand-in served by the replay file, so no third-party logo is committed and the render needs no network.",
